# MFG SUPER MOTION

### Motion beyond the original frame.

**MFG SUPER MOTION** by **NODIX TECH** is a standalone Multi-Frame Generation application designed to make games and video playback smoother using real-time motion analysis and frame generation.

Our goal is to provide a simple, accessible experience without complicated configuration.

🌐 **Website:** https://mfgsm.com/  
📦 **GitHub:** https://github.com/NODIX-TECH/MFG-SUPER-MOTION

## Features

- **Multi-Frame Generation:** Generate additional frames for smoother motion.
- **Adaptive Motion Learning:** Analyze motion to improve frame generation.
- **Real-Time Processing:** Process frames directly on the GPU.
- **Motion Analysis:** Track movement to support frame interpolation.
- **Multiple Generation Modes:** Support different frame-generation configurations.
- **Super Video:** Make video playback smoother.
- **Simple Interface:** Easy activation and accessible settings.

## Project Goals

- Improve motion smoothness while keeping latency low.
- Optimize GPU performance and frame pacing.
- Improve image quality and reduce visual artifacts.
- Expand hardware compatibility.
- Continue improving motion analysis and frame generation.

## ❤️ Support Development

MFG SUPER MOTION is free to use. We do not intend to sell the application.

Support is completely optional. Using the application, sharing it, testing compatibility, and reporting issues all help the project.

## Bug Reports and Feedback

If you encounter a problem, please report it through the GitHub Issues page:

https://github.com/NODIX-TECH/MFG-SUPER-MOTION/issues

Include relevant details about your GPU, game or application, settings, and logs when available.

